# Generated figures.  mfestyle.out() writes fig*.pdf beside the repository root,
# so a reader who follows the README ("MFE_MODE=colour python figs/make_fig33.py")
# lands 84 untracked PDFs here and can commit them by accident.  Four stale ones
# were committed under figs/ that way, and a stale committed figure is worse than
# no figure: it silently replaces the one the generator just rebuilt.
fig*.pdf
